        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Viva, MTV Networks Europe, MTV Networks Europe Local Holdings GmbH\n- Places: United Kingdom, Ireland, Germany\n- Topics: corporate renaming, German company law acronyms\n\nFacts:\n- In August 2004, the owner of Viva in the United Kingdom and Ireland changed its name.\n- The owner of Viva in the United Kingdom and Ireland was renamed MTV Networks Europe Local Holdings GmbH.\n- GmbH is a German company law acronym for a private company with limited liability.",
