        "original_id": "fbc9f731-a1dc-59da-bcc4-2f78ea67b085",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: VIVA Media GmbH, VIVA Media AG\n- Products: Viva (UK and Ireland)\n- Concepts: Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung (GmbH), private company with limited liability\n- Places: Germany, Austria, Switzerland, Liechtenstein, United Kingdom, Ireland\n- Organizations: Viacom International Media Networks Europe\n\nFacts:\n- VIVA Media GmbH was known as VIVA Media AG until 2004.\n- VIVA Media GmbH is a music television network originating from Germany.\n- In German company law, a private company with limited liability is called a Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung (GmbH).\n- A Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung is a legal entity type that is very common in Germany, Austria, Switzerland, and Liechtenstein.\n- In Switzerland, a Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung is equivalent to a S.à r.l.\n- Viva (UK and Ireland), stylised as VIVA, is a music television channel in the United Kingdom and Ireland.\n- Viva (UK and Ireland) is owned by VIVA Media and thereby by Viacom International Media Networks Europe.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
